{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Little Onryo",
    "steam_appid": 3395050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small Onry\u014d, you just can't wait to curse as many chumps as possible - but first you have to power up your Nensha by collecting all the objects in an 8-bit style old school platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/6458f0b5a817aecd3e65e4f4507d5e59.poster.avif?t=1736878934\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/6458f0b5a817aecd3e65e4f4507d5e59.apng?t=1736878934\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your nefarious way through ten different worlds, dodging guardians and nasties, negotiating crumbling platforms, cunning level designs and use your telekenesis and Nesha bolt to solve problematic puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/080349e082750d0f92f663723284260c.poster.avif?t=1736878934\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/080349e082750d0f92f663723284260c.apng?t=1736878934\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fond love letter and parody of the classic 48K games of Matthew Smith and all small and gruesome spirits that dwell in wells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/4f2a56c55f852f2fa2709b2b792cde4e.poster.avif?t=1736878934\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/4f2a56c55f852f2fa2709b2b792cde4e.apng?t=1736878934\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of rooms to explore and solve, including a country house, shopping mall, moon base, furry forest and the most dreaded foe of all - your mother!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of curious enemies with a massive four frames of animation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky jumps and physics puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 blistering colors! (Except when it isn't)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chiptune soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every nook and cranny and save your sisters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school gameplay - it's a challenge, just like the <span class=\"bb_strike\">good</span> old days. You get seven lives to conquer a world and that's it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small Onry\u014d, you just can't wait to curse as many chumps as possible - but first you have to power up your Nensha by collecting all the objects in an 8-bit style old school platformer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/6458f0b5a817aecd3e65e4f4507d5e59.poster.avif?t=1736878934\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/6458f0b5a817aecd3e65e4f4507d5e59.apng?t=1736878934\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your nefarious way through ten different worlds, dodging guardians and nasties, negotiating crumbling platforms, cunning level designs and use your telekenesis and Nesha bolt to solve problematic puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/080349e082750d0f92f663723284260c.poster.avif?t=1736878934\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/080349e082750d0f92f663723284260c.apng?t=1736878934\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fond love letter and parody of the classic 48K games of Matthew Smith and all small and gruesome spirits that dwell in wells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/4f2a56c55f852f2fa2709b2b792cde4e.poster.avif?t=1736878934\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395050/extras/4f2a56c55f852f2fa2709b2b792cde4e.apng?t=1736878934\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of rooms to explore and solve, including a country house, shopping mall, moon base, furry forest and the most dreaded foe of all - your mother!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of curious enemies with a massive four frames of animation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tricky jumps and physics puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 blistering colors! (Except when it isn't)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chiptune soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every nook and cranny and save your sisters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school gameplay - it's a challenge, just like the <span class=\"bb_strike\">good</span> old days. You get seven lives to conquer a world and that's it!</p>",
    "short_description": "Guide a Little Onry\u014d through lots of different worlds in an old school 16-color pixel platformer. Avoid the guardians, dodge the nasties and use your Telekenesis and Nensha Bolt to hit switches, reach objects and achieve your evil goals!",
